# Anything under agents/private/ stays on your machine. That's where the
# study library lives — notes, guidelines, anything with a patient or a
# person in it has no business in a repository, least of all one whose
# CI job pushes commits back. Only the explainer is tracked.
agents/private/*
!agents/private/README.md

# The AI Employee's server keeps the business here; it is someone's own
# data, not part of the app.
employee/server/data/
